OL,3,GNEWSAMurderer's prison death natural,
OL,4,Ainquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murderer died in prison from natural
OL,7,Fcauses, an inquest has found.
OL,9,FMichael Heighton was jailed for life
OL,10,Fwith a minimum term of 12 years in 2009
OL,11,Ffor the murder of Karen Leonard, 40, in
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough.
OL,14,FHe died aged 65 at HMP Frankland in
OL,15,FDurham in December 2024 after illnesses
OL,16,Flinked in part to alcohol abuse led to
OL,17,Fhis health deteriorating, his inquest
OL,18,Fin Crook heard.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
