OL,3,GNEWSAMurderer's prison death natural,
OL,4,Ainquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty Durham and Darlington coroner
OL,7,FCrispin Oliver said doctors had raised
OL,8,Fconcerns Heighton's healthcare might
OL,9,Fhave been neglected in prison, but
OL,10,Fafter investigation no concerns were
OL,11,Ffound.
